// The axis letters x, y and z, which the compiler's word scan accepts as one piece
// of a longer name (`delta_x`) and never as a whole name; a rename has to agree.

// Whether a piece is an axis letter that the scan accepts: x, y or z, in a name
// of more than one piece.
rename_axis_piece(string rename_piece, int rename_piece_count) {
  int rename_is_axis = 0;
  if(rename_piece_count > 1 && (rename_piece == "x" || rename_piece == "y" || rename_piece == "z")) {
    rename_is_axis = 1;
  }
} return int rename_is_axis;
("y", 2):(1)
("z", 3):(1)
("y", 1):(0)
("q", 2):(0)
("xy", 2):(0)
